      "body": "Neueon Corporation Limited announced that Mrs. Surabhi Verma, Independent Director of the Company, has tendered her resignation from the office of Independent Director of the Company with effect from the closure of business hours of January 3, 2026, due to personal reasons. The resignation letter received from Mrs. Surabhi Verma does not contain any other material reasons other than those stated above. Consequently, Mrs. Surabhi Verma shall also cease to be a member of the Committees of the Board, if any, with effect from the said date. The company is required to submit necessary forms with the office of the Registrar of Companies and exchanges to that effect.",
